07-22 01:05:45\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-08-25\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1047\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Well Socials - Being Creative with Other People\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-02-07\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>A monthly event for those who want to be creative with other people!<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Well Socials is our monthly get-together for anyone who likes to be creative and meet new people.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Come along to relax, make, chat, and share ideas in a friendly, welcoming space. We&rsquo;ll have some basic art materials available, and you&rsquo;re more than welcome to bring along something you&rsquo;re already working on.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Whether you just want to doodle, want opinions on something you're working on, or just want to be around other creative people and get inspired - everyone is welcome.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><em>Keeping it Well Social!<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The &pound;5 contribution pays for minimal overhead costs at community cinema, Lumiere Romford.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The cinema has refreshments, hot drinks and food available.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Click the Buy Tickets link to get your ticket.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1770499730well_socials.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1770499730well_socials2.webp\",\"url_key\":\"well-socials\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/well-socials?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-25\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"tra