nce. Lord Nooth plans to take over their land and transform it into a giant mine, forcing Dug and his clan to dig for precious metals. Not ready to go down without a fight, Dug and Hognob must unite their people in an epic quest to defeat a mighty enemy - the Bronze Age.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Infrequent mild bad language, threat<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/hXukFwTKOe7izDsf3ZOdeYikRxF.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/o3XZUwX37gqhpoQcBpqturGTF3Z.webp\",\"url_key\":\"early-man\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/early-man?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-26\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=ZRiPQ8YNrVs\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"ZRiPQ8YNrVs\",\"duration\":\"1h 50m\",\"movie_year\":\"2018\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Eddie Redmayne\"},{\"actor\":\"Tom Hiddleston\"},{\"actor\":\"Maisie Williams\"},{\"actor\":\"Miriam Margolyes\"},{\"actor\":\"Timothy Spall\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Nick Park\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"120\",\"name\":\"Aardman Season\",\"short_name\":\"Aardman\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact t