BAD MOMS and THE HANGOVER, SPA WEEKEND is a hilarious and heartfelt comedy about four lifelong friends who realize that somewhere between careers, relationships, families and everyday responsibilities, they have forgotten how to take care of themselves and each other. Burned out and overdue for a break, the women escape to a luxury spa retreat for what turns out to be an unforgettable weekend dedicated to fun, laughter, and a lot of really bad decisions.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Strong language, sex references, drug misuse<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1785958001a078b4bf-9b30-4c95-917a-0a90392fddae.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/yRsIAwFLDd7QN3Nde0biOwdtDtr.webp\",\"url_key\":\"spa-weekend-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/spa-weekend-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-26\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=9p7j3UvpEQQ\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"9p7j3UvpEQQ\",\"duration\":\"1h 57m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Leslie Mann\"},{\"actor\":\"Isla Fisher\"},{\"actor\":\"Michelle Buteau\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Jon Lucas\"},{\"name\":\"Scott Moore\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly 