vie_countries\":\"United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Action\"},{\"name\":\"Comedy\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Stop! That! Train! follows best friends Tess (Ginger Minj) and DeeDee (Jujubee), train stewardesses who trade their dreary shifts on the Stank Rail for the glitzy Glamazonian Express. When a catastrophic &ldquo;Stormaganza&rdquo; threatens to derail the high-speed train and crash it into Florida, the duo in coach must join forces with the snobby first class attendants (Symone, Brooke Lynn Hytes, Marcia Marcia Marcia) and President Gagwell (RuPaul) to save the day in this wild ride of camp and comedy.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Strong sex references, drug references, language, nudity<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1786393796Adobe_Express_-_file.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/7sdPDXWmACNoaLq0ZpN5m01q43W.webp\",\"url_key\":\"stop-that-train-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/stop-that-train-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-26\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=np6vsy7Rz8I\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"np6vsy7Rz8I\",\"duration\":\"1h 55m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"RuPaul\"},{\"actor\":\"Jujubee\"},{\"actor\":\"Ginger Minj\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Adam Shankman\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"thi