:\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Romance\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>In a staid English seaside town after the Second World War, young Lynda grows up with her widowed father and younger sister. Rebellious Lynda has been swearing constantly from an early age. At sixteen, she becomes more exhibitionist and seeks out sexual encounters challenging the prevailing lower-middle class attitudes to sex.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/cULL2vpyXLK6F3CAsO3h5nCzNQV.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/4BLMhP2NwaGMOyv6zw3VyKqDiUA.webp\",\"url_key\":\"wish-you-were-here-1987\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/wish-you-were-here-1987?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-26\",\"imdb_rate\":\"6.5\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=KJY1Koru_Fs\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"KJY1Koru_Fs\",\"duration\":\"1h 52m\",\"movie_year\":\"1987\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Emily Lloyd\"},{\"actor\":\"Tom Bell\"},{\"actor\":\"Jesse Birdsall\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"David Leland\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"18164\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"TnJmMEJqTkc1am4