ey know he's fast, but what they don't know is that he's a speed demon detective (Paul Walker) with enough drive and determination to come out the winner.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>With intense full-throttle action, awesome high-speed stunts, and full-on pedal to the metal intensity, this fast and furious assault puts you in the driver's seat and dares you to exceed all limits.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Infrequent strong language, moderate violence, sex references<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1786559729FF25_INTL_Anniversary_Digital_1Sheet_UK_V2.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17865597290016776.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-fast-and-the-furious\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/the-fast-and-the-furious?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-29\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=p98ArmqXhUI\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"p98ArmqXhUI\",\"duration\":\"2h 7m\",\"movie_year\":\"2001\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Paul Walker\"},{\"actor\":\"Vin Diesel\"},{\"actor\":\"Michelle Rodriguez\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Rob Cohen\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"65\",\"name\":\"Anniversary re-release\",\"short_name\":\"anniversar\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"1\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/12Acert1741549098.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"12A\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"12A\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"