,\"synopsis\":\"<p>What if one messy night turns out to be the best thing that ever happened to you? Recently dumped Owen and hopeful romantic Allie might be the only two singles in the city looking for more than just a quick encounter. They both feel a spark when they meet, but a series of missteps and side quests complicate their night, keeping them apart. As they each race toward and away from each other across the city, they just might discover that the one thing they want most is closer than they think.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">strong language, sex references<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1784735339MV5BMjQ5MmMxMjItNWQ5NC00OGI1LWFjNTYtYjA3NjNmM2EzNmIyXkEyXkFqcGc@__V1_FMjpg_UX1000_.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17835232642607_D022_00966R_Large.webp\",\"url_key\":\"one-night-only\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/one-night-only?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-29\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=OvpkEvpEeN0\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"OvpkEvpEeN0\",\"duration\":\"2h 2m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Monica Barbaro\"},{\"actor\":\"Callum Turner\"},{\"actor\":\"Maya Hawke\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Will Gluck\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this 