"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-09-01\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1381\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Dog Stars\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-08-26\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"name\":\"Thriller\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Hig (Jacob Elordi), a young pilot, together with a military survivalist, Bangley (Josh Brolin), has carved out an efficient but isolated homestead in a brutal post-apocalyptic world. But when Hig receives a mysterious radio transmission, he ventures into the unknown in search of the hope and humanity he still believes exist.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Strong language, violence, injury detail<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Please note this film contains several sequences with flashing lights that may affect those who are susceptible to photosensitive epilepsy or have other photosensitivities.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/w7c49Qgp3TAUC4hlo0mtgRpLOGG.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/5cgiN7zADfleheeUPWg0SChGtUB.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-dog-stars-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/the-dog-stars-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-01\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=nk4DyDsq5PY\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"nk4DyDsq5PY\",\"duration\":\"2h 20m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Jacob Elordi\"},{\"actor\":\"Josh Brolin\"},{\"actor\":\"Margaret Qualley\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Ridley Scott\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_s