ame\":\"Comedy\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"},{\"name\":\"Mystery\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Tired from decades of being blown up by explosive ACME products whilst in pursuit of the uncatchable Road Runner, Wile E. Coyote teams up with lawyer Kevin Avery (Will Forte) to fight back in Coyote vs ACME. But ACME has its own powerhouse defence attorney in Kevin&rsquo;s slick nemesis Buddy Crane (John Cena), who is determined to silence Wile E. and Kevin. Wile E. and Kevin embark on a wild quest for justice that&rsquo;s as thrilling and physics-defying as Wile E.&rsquo;s lifelong chase for the ever-speedy Road Runner.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/7zNmJP6z6mDAp4LouacYkGSBUQv.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1784482332images.webp\",\"url_key\":\"coyote-vs-acme-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/coyote-vs-acme-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-03\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=FF8CPvF-SJE\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"FF8CPvF-SJE\",\"duration\":\"2h 3m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Will Forte\"},{\"actor\":\"Lana Condor\"},{\"actor\":\"Tone Bell\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Dave Green\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.