          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1407\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Pirates! In an Adventure with Scientists!\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-08-14\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United Kingdom, United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"name\":\"Animation\"},{\"name\":\"Comedy\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>The luxuriantly bearded Pirate Captain is a boundlessly enthusiastic, if somewhat less-than-successful, terror of the High Seas. With a rag-tag crew at his side, and seemingly blind to the impossible odds stacked against him, the Captain has one dream: to beat his bitter rivals Black Bellamy and Cutlass Liz to the much coveted Pirate Of The Year Award. It's a quest that takes our heroes from the shores of exotic Blood Island to the foggy streets of Victorian London. Along the way they battle with the pirate-hating Queen Victoria and team up with a young Charles Darwin, but never lose sight of what a pirate loves best: adventure!<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/bkLeXPDP6sramrTiF5W7TzUl4t0.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/9UZnCIeUVHzZQLDXN7lht2T4ndB.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-pirates-in-an-adventure-with-scientists-2012\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/the-pirates-in-an-adventure-with-scientists-2012?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-05\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=DWOFLtsDvbw\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"DWOFLtsDvbw\",\"duration\":\"1h 48m\",\"movie_year\":\"2012\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Hugh Grant\"},{\"actor\":\"Martin Freeman\"},{\"actor\":\"Imelda Staunton\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Peter Lord\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id