\":\"2026-08-23 18:54:49\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-09-05\"},{\"movie_id\":\"664\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Twin Peaks Season 1 Marathon [5th September]\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-09-05\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Mystery\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Saturday 5th September, 10:30am-approx 6:15pm<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Episode schedule<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The feature-length first episode, then episodes 2-8.&nbsp;Total runtime including breaks = just under 8 hours.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><em>There will be a 10 minute break after every 90 minutes of programming.<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>What your ticket gets you<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>All 8 episodes of the first season<\\/strong> of the groundbreaking Twin Peaks served up over one glorious marathon day, with damn fine coffee and donuts thrown in with your ticket!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>About Twin Peaks Season 1<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>When popular high school student Laura Palmer is found murdered, FBI Special Agent Dale Cooper arrives in the quirky town of Twin Peaks, Washington. He discovers that Laura led a dark double life, amidst a community seething with secrets. Cooper, aided by Sheriff Truman, begins to unravel the town's hidden underbelly.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>His unconventional methods, including interpreting surreal dreams, guide the investigation and he starts to piece together the evidence, which points towards the killer being local.&nbsp;As the season concludes, dark plots intensify, and the search for Laura's killer deepens, revealing unsettling supernatural forces at play.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Can't get enough of Twin Peaks?<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/twinpeaks-season1\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><strong>Twin Peaks: Season 1 - All Day Marathon<\\/strong><\\/a><\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/twin-peaks-season2\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Twin Peaks: Season 2&nbsp;- Two Day Marathon<\\/a><\\/strong> (split into two parts over two days),<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>and <strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/twinpeaks-thereturn\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Twin Peaks: The Return (Season 3)&nbsp;- Two Day Marathon<\\/a><\\/strong> (again split into two parts over two days).&nbsp;<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Search for \\\"Twin Peaks\\\" in the search bar.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1759355922twinpeaks_s1.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1759352810twinpeaks_s1_featuredpic.webp\",\"url_key\":\"twinpeaks-season1\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/twinpeaks-season1?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-05\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=oPeR6k1xCkM\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"oPeR6k1xCkM\",\"duration\":\"7h 45m\",\"movie_year\":\"1990\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Kyle MacLachlan\"},{\"actor\":\"Sherilyn Fenn\"},{\"actor\":\"Lara Flynn Boyle\"},{\"actor\":\"M\\u00e4dchen Amick\"},{\"actor\":\"Michael Ontkean\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"David Lynch\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"39\",\"name\":\"Marathons & All-Dayers!\",\"short_name\":\"all day\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"116\",\"name\":\"Twin Peaks season\",\"short_name\":\"Twin Peaks\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"16993\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"c3hVc0t4Mm5kblFhZVlxWForUlFwZz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/twinpeaks-season1\\/showtimes\\/2026-09-05\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=c3hVc0t4Mm5kblFhZVlxWForUlFwZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"4\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-05\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:30AM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.30\",\"time_sorting\":1788600600,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-07-14 14:37:29\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-09-05\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1516\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Romford Short Film Festival 2026, (5-6 September)\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-09-05\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Festival\"},{\"name\":\"Indie\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Join us on 5th and 6th September for the second annual Romford Short Film Festival!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Passes are just &pound;5 for Members or &pound;10 for Non Members. <strong>1 pass&nbsp;covers you for both days of the festival.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>So that's&nbsp;2 days of short films, filmmaker Q&As, networking, and mingling fun times at the bar for a bargain price!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>See the full lineup at&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.romfordfilmfestival.com\\/shortfilmfest\\\">https:\\/\\/www.romfordfilmfestival.com\\/shortfilmfest<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1786727896IMG-20260814-WA0008.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1787663014rsff.webp\",\"url_key\":\"rsff-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/rsff-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-05\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"12h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_cer