          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1516\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Romford Short Film Festival 2026, (5-6 September)\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-09-05\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Festival\"},{\"name\":\"Indie\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Join us on 5th and 6th September for the second annual Romford Short Film Festival!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Passes are just &pound;5 for Members or &pound;10 for Non Members. <strong>1 pass&nbsp;covers you for both days of the festival.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>So that's&nbsp;2 days of short films, filmmaker Q&As, networking, and mingling fun times at the bar for a bargain price!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>See the full lineup at&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.romfordfilmfestival.com\\/shortfilmfest\\\">https:\\/\\/www.romfordfilmfestival.com\\/shortfilmfest<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1786727896IMG-20260814-WA0008.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1787663014rsff.webp\",\"url_key\":\"rsff-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/rsff-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-06\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"12h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"18261\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"OTFoR2QxL2QwcGJ6dFFFdFZ6THZKUT09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/rsff-2026\\/showtimes\\/2026-09-06\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=OTFoR2QxL2QwcGJ6dFFFdFZ6THZKUT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"42\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-06\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:30AM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.30\",\"time_sorting\":1788687000,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-08-14 18:23:48\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-09-06\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1407\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Pirates! In an Adventure with Scientists!\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-08-14\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United Kingdom, United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"name\":\"Animation\"},{\"name\":\"Comedy\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>The luxuriantly bearded Pirate Captain is a boundlessly enthusiastic, if somewhat less-than-successful, terror of the High Seas. With a rag-tag crew at his side, and seemingly blind to the impossible odds stacked against him, the Captain has one dream: to beat his bitter rivals Black Bellamy and Cutlass Liz to the much coveted Pirate Of The Year Award. It's a quest that takes our heroes from the shores of exotic Blood Island to the foggy streets of Victorian London. Along the way they battle with the pirate-hating Queen Victoria and team up with a young Charles Darwin, but never lose sight of what a pirate loves best: adventure!<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/bkLeXPDP6sramrTiF5W7TzUl4t0.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/9UZnCIeUVHzZQLDXN7lht2T4ndB.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-pirates-in-an-adventure-with-scientists-2012\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/the-pirates-in-an-adventure-with-scientists-2012?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-06\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=DWOFLtsDvbw\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"DWOFLtsDvbw\",\"duration\":\"1h 48m\",\"movie_year\":\"2012\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Hugh Grant\"},{\"actor\":\"Martin Freeman\"},{\"actor\":\"Imelda Staunton\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Peter Lord\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"120\",\"name\":\"Aardman Season\",\"short_name\":\"Aardman\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"2\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/Ucert1741549224.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"U\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"U\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_comin