          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1406\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Colony\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-08-28\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"South Korea\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Horror\"},{\"name\":\"Thriller\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Professor Se-jeong (Jun) is thrust into a bloody nightmare when a rapidly mutating virus is released during a biotech conference causing authorities to seal the facility. Trapped inside with no escape, Se-jeong along with a small group of survivors must fight to stay alive while the infected undergo horrific transformations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Contains strong horror, bloody images, violence, language.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/tN799oUR0f1gUKDYdMNrDaY7I51.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/jDvxsBemt2Iyslg7qn2WMzgxz23.webp\",\"url_key\":\"colony-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/colony-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-09\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=Je122ZNo6uw\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"Je122ZNo6uw\",\"duration\":\"2h 23m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Gianna Jun\"},{\"actor\":\"Koo Kyo-hwan\"},{\"actor\":\"Ji Chang-wook\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Yeon Sang-ho\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[{\"id\":\"8\",\"name\":\"English Subtitles\",\"short_name\":\"Eng Sub\",\"description\":null},{\"id\":\"12\",\"name\":\"Korean\",\"short_name\":\"Kor\",\"description\":null}],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"15\",\"mo