tale. Set of its time, the film sees the title character grappling with his past after a life of crime and murder; a battleworn loner who finds himself gravely injured after a battle he thought would be his last. In the hands of a mysterious woman, he is offered a chance at salvation.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Strong bloody violence, injury detail<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1787185668ONE_SHEET_1.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1787185668STILL-01_1.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-death-of-robin-hood-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/the-death-of-robin-hood-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=uhGvbX_8E1Y\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"uhGvbX_8E1Y\",\"duration\":\"2h 23m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Hugh Jackman\"},{\"actor\":\"Jodie Comer\"},{\"actor\":\"Bill Skarsg\\u00e5rd\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Michael Sarnoski\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"18625\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"dTB3dExzNno4Z2N1ZmpWTW9mN3k4dz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\