\",\"movie_name\":\"The Twilight Saga: New Moon\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-07-17\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Fantasy\"},{\"name\":\"Romance\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Forks, Washington resident Bella Swan is reeling from the departure of her vampire love, Edward Cullen, and finds comfort in her friendship with Jacob Black, a werewolf. But before she knows it, she's thrust into a centuries-old conflict, and her desire to be with Edward at any cost leads her to take greater and greater risks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>PLEASE NOTE WE ARE PLAYING ALL 5 TWILIGHT FILMS BACK-TO-BACK ON SATURDAY 12TH SEPTEMBER. UNFORTUNATELY THERE IS NO MARATHON TICKET FOR THIS, INDIVIDUAL TICKETS WILL NEED TO BE PURCHASED FOR EACH FILM.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/k2qTooPlHffgNABNWxeJdGMglPK.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/dF2c20sRDgySZLaLS2OUerL07sz.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-twilight-saga-new-moon-2009\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/the-twilight-saga-new-moon-2009?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-12\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 31m\",\"movie_year\":\"2009\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Kristen Stewart\"},{\"actor\":\"Robert Pattinson\"},{\"actor\":\"Taylor Lautner\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Chris Weitz\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"117\",\"name\":\"The Twilight Saga Season\",\"short_name\":\"twilight\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"1\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/12Acer