,\"date_release_date\":\"2026-09-13\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Documentary\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>For one night only, we are holding a fundraiser for Harold Hill Deer Aid, Wildlife Rescue.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The night includes a screening of the documentary film 'Whispers In The Woods' plus an opportunity to socialise and enter a raffle to win cinema tickets and full year passes. Celebrate and aid the work of Harold Hill Deer Aid by coming and making a financial donation to the organisation.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>In addition to the raffle, attendees can also help by having a social drink, as a percentage of all alcohol sales will also go towards the organisation too.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Sunday 13th September 7pm, the bar will be open from 4pm.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Tickets are by cash donation on the door, no prior booking.<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Come and watch the award-winning documentary film Whispers In The Woods and support a local organisation at the same time that does so much good for our wildlife population.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1782606338da946973-2aab-49b6-821d-50d9b8e279a4.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1782606338maxresdefault_27.webp\",\"url_key\":\"deer-aid-whispers-in-the-woods\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/deer-aid-whispers-in-the-woods?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-13\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=2W9KOuEOwBs\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"2W9KOuEOwBs\",\"duration\":\"1h 40m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"122\",\"name\":\"Fundraising event\",\"short_name\":\"fundraiser\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_l