          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1419\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Raiders of the Lost Ark: 45th Anniversary\",\"date_release_date\":\"1981-06-12\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Action\"},{\"name\":\"Adventure\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Steven Spielberg&rsquo;s iconic 1981 blockbuster that introduced the world to Harrison Ford&rsquo;s legendary archaeologist, Indiana Jones.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Whip-smart, fearless, and endlessly entertaining, Indy races against time (and the Nazis) to recover the fabled Ark of the Covenant in a globe-trotting quest packed with traps, treasure, and non-stop thrills.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Whether you're discovering it for the first time or revisiting an old favourite, Raiders remains the perfect mix of action, humour, and heart.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Moderate violence, threat, horror.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/ceG9VzoRAVGwivFU403Wc3AHRys-c-1784593154-7739.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/ueDw7djPgKPZfph0vC43aD2EMyF-c-1784593154-7530.webp\",\"url_key\":\"raiders-of-the-lost-ark-45th\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/raiders-of-the-lost-ark-45th?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-14\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=XkkzKHCx154\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"XkkzKHCx154\",\"duration\":\"2h 15m\",\"movie_year\":\"1981\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Harrison Ford\"},{\"actor\":\"Karen Allen\"},{\"actor\":\"Paul Freeman\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Steven Spielberg\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"119\",\"name\":\"Steven Spielberg season\",\"short_name\":\"spielberg\",\"