ate violence, threat, horror.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/ceG9VzoRAVGwivFU403Wc3AHRys-c-1784593154-7739.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/ueDw7djPgKPZfph0vC43aD2EMyF-c-1784593154-7530.webp\",\"url_key\":\"raiders-of-the-lost-ark-45th\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/raiders-of-the-lost-ark-45th?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=XkkzKHCx154\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"XkkzKHCx154\",\"duration\":\"2h 15m\",\"movie_year\":\"1981\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Harrison Ford\"},{\"actor\":\"Karen Allen\"},{\"actor\":\"Paul Freeman\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Steven Spielberg\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"119\",\"name\":\"Steven Spielberg season\",\"short_name\":\"spielberg\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"1\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/12Acert1741549098.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"12A\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"12A\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"17477\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"ZXBqUUQwRC9uS0tEWnh4Mk5tTWVSZz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/raiders-of-the-lost-ark-45th\\/showtimes\\/2026-09-16\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=ZXBqUUQwRC9uS0tEW