          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1492\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Doctor Who: Spearhead from Space\",\"date_release_date\":\"1970-01-24\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United Kingdom\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>The New Doctor arrives on Earth in the middle of a freak meteor shower. Faceless killer shop window dummies are coming to life and killing anything that comes into their path while Facsimiles are replacing top Military, Political and Civil leaders. The Nestene has come to invade the Earth. The convalescent Doctor teams up with Brigadier Lethbridge-Stewart and Dr. Elizabeth Shaw of UNIT to thwart the Nestine's plans even as the invasion begins.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The intention, is to show a complete Doctor Who story once a month beginning from the start of the Colour era, the reason is that it allows complete stories and seasons to run concurrently without voids from the start of Jon Oertwee's era and through classic who.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Please book early, the licenses for Doctor Who are quite expensive and if it appears we will not make the money to cover the screening costs we will cancel them, so please book in advance if you can so we can see we are generating enough interest.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/e00uhXgyI4tN1VmIpbQ34b8LrAa.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/2YhfapyPqSPaPzS9PBOeKMDZnXV.webp\",\"url_key\":\"doctor-who-spearhead-from-space-1970\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/doctor-who-spearhead-from-space-1970?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-19\",\"imdb_rate\":\"8.7\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"1h 57m\",\"movie_year\":\"1970\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Jon Pertwee\