          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1398\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Darkside Magazine - Nasty Fest, Volume 2\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-09-20\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Horror\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Last year&rsquo;s Video Nasties day at the fabulous Lumiere cinema in Romford was a massive success so it was only natural that we jump back on the banned wagon for a second day of pure uncensored fun &ndash; especially as we have just reprinted our best-selling Video Nasties 2 volume &ndash; officially out of print since 2001!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This time round we have delved within the pages of this pictorial guide to movies that bite to select no fewer than 8 sleazy, salacious (and frankly, not for the prudish) films that haven&rsquo;t seen the light of a projector bulb in a very long time &ndash; if ever!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Want to know what&rsquo;s on offer? Well pin your ears and eyeballs back and get a load of this lot: <strong>The Amazing Mr. No Leg<\\/strong>s (never push him around), <strong>Elsa Fraulein SS<\\/strong> (Melissa Longo does an Ilsa), <strong>Trapped<\\/strong> (brilliant red-neck horror with Henry Silva), <strong>Tomb of the Living Dead<\\/strong> (Mad doctors, green monsters and Star Trek porn stars), <strong>GBH<\\/strong> (Cliff Twemlow&rsquo;s violent clubland bruiser), <strong>Raw Force<\\/strong> (zombies, cannibals, outrageous action, gore, copious amounts of nudity),<strong> Blue Eyes of the Broken Doll<\\/strong> (Naschy lunacy) and <strong>Blood Vengeance<\\/strong> (Big George Eastman in a sex and horror classic).<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>All these films and more will be showing <em>uncut<\\/em> at the Lumiere Cinema from 11am in the morning until 11pm at night, so it&rsquo;s a no-brainer if you&rsquo;re up for a whole day of sex, horror and perversion &ndash; and that&rsquo;s just in the bar area!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This isn&rsquo;t an official DarkFest; you&rsquo;ll all have to wait until November 21st for that, but we still will be bringing that cosy DarkFest vibe to downtown Romford.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>There will be lots of socialising, plenty of dealer tables and some great guests. At present we&rsquo;re pretty sure we will be joined by our DarkFest gals, Caroline Munro, Maddy Smith, Pauline Peart and Martine Beswick, and if Ian McCulloch doesn&rsquo;t show up we&rsquo;ll send someone round for him. Other star guests have yet to be confirmed but it will be a blast under any circumstances. And of course yours truly Allan Bryce will be on hand to sign copies of Video Nasties 2 all day. As a special incentive to attend we will be selling signed books on the day for just &pound;20 each.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The Lumiere Cinema is located in The Mercury Shopping Centre , Level 3, Mercury Gardens, Romford, RM1 3EE and we&rsquo;d love to have you join us.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/thedarksidemagazine.com\\/product\\/video-nasties-fest-2\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><strong>TICKETS NEED TO BE PURCHASED DIRECTLY&nbsp;THROUGH THE DARKSIDE WEBSITE, HERE.<\\/strong><\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1784224939IMG_2815.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1784224939IMG_2815_2.webp\",\"url_key\":\"video-nasties-fest-copy\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/video-nasties-fest-copy?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-20\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"12h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"39\",\"name\":\"Marathons & All-Dayers!\",\"short_name\":\"all day\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/thedarksidemagazine.com\\/product\\/video-nasties-fest-2\\/\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"17121\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"RTNIcjhmTFUxcmVZOUtzV0FrSENhQT09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/video-nasties-fest-copy\\/showtimes\\/2026-09-20\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=RTNIcjhmTFUxcmVZOUtzV0FrSENhQT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-20\",\"show_time_slots\":\"11:00AM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"11.00\",\"time_sorting\":1789898400,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-07-16 19:42:22\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/thedarksidemagazine.com\\/product\\/video-nasties-fest-2\\/\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-09-20\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1492\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Doctor Who: Spearhead from Space\",\"date_release_date\":\"1970-01-24\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United Kingdom\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>The New Doctor arrives on Earth in the middle of a freak meteor shower. Faceless killer shop window dummies are coming to life and killing anything that comes into their path while Facsimiles are replacing top Military, Political and Civil leaders. The Nestene has come to invade the Earth. The convalescent Doctor teams up with Brigadier Lethbridge-Stewart and Dr. Elizabeth Shaw of UNIT to thwart the Nestine's plans even as the invasion begins.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The intention, is to show a complete Doctor Who story once a month beginning from the start of the Colour era, the reason is that it allows complete stories and seasons to run concurrently without voids from the start of Jon Oertwee's era and through classic who.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Please book early, the licenses for Doctor Who are quite expensive and if it appears we will not make the money to cover the screening costs we will cancel them, so please book in advance if you can so we can see we are generating enough interest.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/e00uhXgyI4tN1VmIpbQ34b8LrAa.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/2YhfapyPqSPaPzS9PBOeKMDZnXV.webp\",\"url_key\":\"doctor-who-spearhead-from-space-1970\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/doctor-who-spearhead-from-space-1970?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"20