          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1198\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"King's Day\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-04-26\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Horror\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Celebrate the birthday of Stephen King the best way you possibly can, here at Lumiere.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Over the course of 13 hours you'll enjoy some outstanding King classic movie adaptations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>There will be vampires, killer kids, psychic's anthologies and killer vehicles.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This epic mystery day of King movies charts the early part of Stephen King's foray into the cinematic universe with features from a 10 year period from 1979 to 1989.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Not just the old favourites, there's a few films that seemingly have been forgotten by time too.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The day will run in chronological order, but what you see is a mystery until it starts!<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1778532049king.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1777237189IMG_4123.webp\",\"url_key\":\"stephenking\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/stephenking?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-21\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"13h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"39\",\"name\":\"Marathons & All-Dayers!\",\"short_name\":\"all day\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"