            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1373\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Starship Troopers\",\"date_release_date\":\"1997-11-07\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"name\":\"Thriller\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Set in the future, the story follows a young soldier named Johnny Rico and his exploits in the Mobile Infantry. Rico's military career progresses from recruit to non-commissioned officer and finally to officer against the backdrop of an interstellar war between mankind and an arachnoid species known as \\\"the Bugs.\\\"<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1783467094cxCmv23O7p3hyHwqoktHYkZcGsY.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/7iEfnj3rfyunky6BzvnlwqfoEF0.webp\",\"url_key\":\"starship-troopers-1997\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/starship-troopers-1997?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-22\",\"imdb_rate\":\"7.1\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 29m\",\"movie_year\":\"1997\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Casper Van Dien\"},{\"actor\":\"Dina Meyer\"},{\"actor\":\"Denise Richards\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Paul Verhoeven\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorr