old she has a brain tumor by her doctor, Frederick Steele, Judith becomes distraught. After she decides to have surgery to remove the tumor, Judith realizes she is in love with Dr. Steele, but more troubling medical news may sabotage her new relationship, and her second chance at life.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/zfgRdIEV68mIvuFxkuEcP8CcvCQ.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/jsIYE5ntyzkJlGKiJcKFGYqH9yN.webp\",\"url_key\":\"dark-victory-1939\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/dark-victory-1939?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-22\",\"imdb_rate\":\"6.9\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 4m\",\"movie_year\":\"1939\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Bette Davis\"},{\"actor\":\"George Brent\"},{\"actor\":\"Humphrey Bogart\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Edmund Goulding\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"17244\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"QjMyUDcvUEsxTlhvbEU3MlJWTVhIUT09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/dark-victory-1939\\/showtimes\\/2026-09-22\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=QjMy