"date_release_date\":\"1939-04-20\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Romance\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Socialite Judith Traherne lives a lavish but emotionally empty life. Riding horses is one of her few joys, and her stable master is secretly in love with her. Told she has a brain tumor by her doctor, Frederick Steele, Judith becomes distraught. After she decides to have surgery to remove the tumor, Judith realizes she is in love with Dr. Steele, but more troubling medical news may sabotage her new relationship, and her second chance at life.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/zfgRdIEV68mIvuFxkuEcP8CcvCQ.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/jsIYE5ntyzkJlGKiJcKFGYqH9yN.webp\",\"url_key\":\"dark-victory-1939\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/dark-victory-1939?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-24\",\"imdb_rate\":\"6.9\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 4m\",\"movie_year\":\"1939\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Bette Davis\"},{\"actor\":\"George Brent\"},{\"actor\":\"Humphrey Bogart\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Edmund Goulding\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"17242\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"UkNXbERxeDRXVXUrN2hoc0pCbGtFUT09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/dark-victory-1939\\/showtimes\\/2026-09-24\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=UkNXbERxeDRXVXUrN2hoc0pCbGtFUT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-24\",\"show_time_slots\":\"3:35PM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"15.35\",\"time_sorting\":1790260500,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-07-17 22:07:13\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-09-24\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1373\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Starship Troopers\",\"date_release_date\":\"1997-11-07\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"name\":\"Thriller\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Set in the future, the story follows a young soldier named Johnny Rico and his exploits in the Mobile Infantry. Rico's military career progresses from recruit to non-commissioned officer and finally to officer against the backdrop of an interstellar war between mankind and an arachnoid species known as \\\"the Bugs.\\\"<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1783467094cxCmv23O7p3hyHwqoktHYkZcGsY.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/7iEfnj3rfyunky6BzvnlwqfoEF0.webp\",\"url_key\":\"starship-troopers-1997\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/starship-troopers-1997?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-24\",\"imdb_rate\":\"7.1\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 29m\",\"movie_year\":\"1997\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Casper Van Dien\"},{\"actor\":\"Dina Meyer\"},{\"actor\":\"Denise Richards\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Paul Verhoeven\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"17228\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"MFFaRzlVbGpGZStQYmMzcE5QdDRqZz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/starship-troopers-1997\\/showtimes\\/2026-09-24\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=MFFaR