her truth in a world that would rather silence her.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Filmed live on stage at the National Theatre, Indhu Rubasingham directs Martin Crimp&rsquo;s (Cyrano de Bergerac) highly anticipated play.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1780698433NTL_2026_The_Misanthrope_-_Listing_Image_Portrait_874x1240px.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1780698433NTL_2026_The_Misanthrope_-_Listing_Image_Landscape_1240x874px.webp\",\"url_key\":\"national-theatre-live-the-misanthrope-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/national-theatre-live-the-misanthrope-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-27\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 40m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Sandra Oh\"},{\"actor\":\"Paul Chahidi\"},{\"actor\":\"Abigail Cruttenden\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Indhu Rubasingham\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"38\",\"name\":\"Event Cinema\",\"short_name\":\"event cine\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"69\",\"name\":\"National Theatre Live\",\"short_name\":\"nt-live\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"15682\",\"show_time_uuid