g government agents and discovering that sometimes, the most powerful force in the universe is connection.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Contains very mild language and threat<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1784570137et.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17845595740013837.webp\",\"url_key\":\"et-the-extra-terrestrial-1982\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/et-the-extra-terrestrial-1982?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-27\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=DSx8Jobx-Gs\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"DSx8Jobx-Gs\",\"duration\":\"2h 15m\",\"movie_year\":\"1982\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Henry Thomas\"},{\"actor\":\"Drew Barrymore\"},{\"actor\":\"Robert MacNaughton\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Steven Spielberg\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"119\",\"name\":\"Steven Spielberg season\",\"short_name\":\"spielberg\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"2\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/Ucert1741549224.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"U\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"U\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"18667\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"eWI4VnBWL29TOHBwYWkva2tSRGNQZz09\",\"page_link\":\"https: