y to support their untested RoboCop prototype. But when RoboCop learns of the company's nefarious plans, he turns on his masters.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1784204068download_15.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/xcaX6BZ1JUPSVMH2gBkWIckLLaA.webp\",\"url_key\":\"robocop-1987\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/robocop-1987?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-09-27\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 2m\",\"movie_year\":\"1987\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Peter Weller\"},{\"actor\":\"Nancy Allen\"},{\"actor\":\"Dan O'Herlihy\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Paul Verhoeven\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"17237\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"RUlJYjEwNzRWV2pTTk1KUDg5K09QZz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/robocop-1987\\/showtimes\\/2026-09-27\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=RUlJYjEwNzRWV2pTTk1KUDg5K09QZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"sess