t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-10-02\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1479\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Boorman and the Devil\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Documentary\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Boorman and the Devil details how Academy Award-nominated director John Boorman took on the massive 1977 sequel Exorcist II: The Heretic, turning down standard horror tropes for a high-budget, metaphysical misfire that became one of Hollywood's most famous box-office disasters.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1787176515Boorman_and_the_Devil_-_One_Sheet.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1787176429fss.webp\",\"url_key\":\"boorman-and-the-devil-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/boorman-and-the-devil-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=qt1J4OQ38Uo\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"qt1J4OQ38Uo\",\"duration\":\"2h 12m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"John Boorman\"},{\"actor\":\"Louise Fletcher\"},{\"actor\":\"Karyn Kusama\"},{\"actor\":\"Mike Flanagan\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"David Kittredge\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"125\",\"name\":\"John Boorman season\",\"short_name\":\"boorman\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"6\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/file21762743298.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"TBC\",\"movie_certificati