",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Black Rain\",\"date_release_date\":\"1989-09-22\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Thriller\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Two New York cops get involved in a gang war between members of the Yakuza, the Japanese Mafia. They arrest one of their killers and are ordered to escort him back to Japan. However, in Japan he manages to escape, and as they try to track him down, they get deeper and deeper into the Japanese Mafia scene and they have to learn that they can only win by playing the game&mdash;the Japanese way.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/funhGWt9ee3Uwb6Ar8SGCCvbJdV.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/qExU5Kb9p21geurT0EhknVcPIki.webp\",\"url_key\":\"black-rain-1989\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/black-rain-1989?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"imdb_rate\":\"6.6\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=h43kW_96xTU\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"h43kW_96xTU\",\"duration\":\"2h 25m\",\"movie_year\":\"1989\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Michael Douglas\"},{\"actor\":\"Andy Garcia\"},{\"actor\":\"Ken Takakura\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Ridley Scott\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_mes