          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"665\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Twin Peaks Season 2 Marathon [3rd-4th October]\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-10-03\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Mystery\"},{\"name\":\"Thriller\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Episode schedule<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><strong>Day 1: Saturday 3rd October, 10:30am-approx 8pm.<\\/strong><\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>The feature-length first Episode, then Episodes 2-10. Runtime including breaks = around 9 and a half hours.<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><strong>Day 2: Sunday 4th October, 10:30am - approx 8:30pm.<\\/strong><\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>Episodes 11-22.&nbsp;Runtime including breaks = around&nbsp;10 hours.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><em>There will be a 10 minute break after every 90 minutes of episodes.<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">What your ticket gets you<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your ticket gives you entrance to <strong>BOTH DAYS<\\/strong>\\/<strong>all 22 episodes<\\/strong> of the second season of Twin Peaks served up over TWO glorious marathon days, with damn fine coffee and donuts thrown in with your ticket!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">About Season 2<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Season Two of Twin Peaks immediately picks up following the dramatic events of the first season finale, as FBI Special Agent Dale Cooper finds himself in a precarious situation. The investigation into the murder of homecoming queen Laura Palmer continues to be the central focus, pushing Cooper and Sheriff Harry S. Truman to delve deeper into the darkest secrets of the seemingly tranquil town. As they pursue new leads, the bizarre and supernatural elements that only surfaced on the edges of the first season come to the fore, revealing a terrifying, otherworldly dimension to the crime and the town itself.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The season explores the fallout from Laura Palmer&rsquo;s death on the many interwoven lives of Twin Peaks' quirky residents, with various characters dealing with unexpected turns of fortune, personal crises, and dangerous conspiracies. While the initial mystery is eventually resolved, the aftermath introduces an even greater threat in the form of a brilliant, vengeful figure from Agent Cooper&rsquo;s past. This new antagonist forces Cooper to confront the limits of his understanding, leading him and his allies toward a mysterious locale known as the Black Lodge, where the battle between good and evil takes on a terrifying and reality-bending form.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Can't get enough of Twin Peaks?<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/twinpeaks-season1\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Twin Peaks: Season 1 - All Day Marathon<\\/a><\\/strong><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/twin-peaks-season2\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Twin Peaks: Season 2&nbsp;- Two Day Marathon<\\/a><\\/strong> (split into two parts over two days),<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>and <strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/twinpeaks-thereturn\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Twin Peaks: The Return (Season 3) - Two Day Marathon<\\/a><\\/strong>&nbsp;(again split into two parts over two days)<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Search for \\\"Twin Peaks\\\" in the search bar.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1759357806twinpeaks_s2a.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1759630599S2_E19--Variations-on-Relations.webp\",\"url_key\":\"twin-peaks-season2\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/twin-peaks-season2?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-03\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=JPdZNCgIDek\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"JPdZNCgIDek\",\"duration\":\"10h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"1991\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Kyle MacLachlan\"},{\"actor\":\"Michael Ontkean\"},{\"actor\":\"M\\u00e4dchen Amick\"},{\"actor\":\"Dana Ashbrook\"},{\"actor\":\"Richard Beymer\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"David Lynch\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"39\",\"name\":\"Marathons & All-Dayers!\",\"short_name\":\"all day\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"116\",\"name\":\"Twin Peaks season\",\"short_name\":\"Twin Peaks\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"16994\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"d1B6aVc3MTJ1OFM0cmpWTUxwZDVsZz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/twin-peaks-season2\\/showtimes\\/2026-10-03\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=d1B6aVc3MTJ1OFM0cmpWTUxwZDVsZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"4\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-03\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:30AM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.30\",\"time_sorting\":179101