          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1452\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Black Rain\",\"date_release_date\":\"1989-09-22\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Thriller\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Two New York cops get involved in a gang war between members of the Yakuza, the Japanese Mafia. They arrest one of their killers and are ordered to escort him back to Japan. However, in Japan he manages to escape, and as they try to track him down, they get deeper and deeper into the Japanese Mafia scene and they have to learn that they can only win by playing the game&mdash;the Japanese way.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/funhGWt9ee3Uwb6Ar8SGCCvbJdV.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/qExU5Kb9p21geurT0EhknVcPIki.webp\",\"url_key\":\"black-rain-1989\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/black-rain-1989?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-04\",\"imdb_rate\":\"6.6\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=h43kW_96xTU\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"h43kW_96xTU\",\"duration\":\"2h 25m\",\"movie_year\":\"1989\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Michael Douglas\"},{\"actor\":\"Andy Garcia\"},{\"actor\":\"Ken Takakura\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Ridley Scott\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"18276\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"emI0V1ZVR1I2VjZjdzlkZVcxZnV0dz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/black-rain-1989\\/showtimes\\/2026-10-04\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=emI0V1ZVR1I2VjZjdzlkZVcxZnV0dz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 5\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-04\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:30AM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.30\",\"time_sorting\":1791106200,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-08-17 10:44:25\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-10-04\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1270\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Cheese & Port Afternoon [4th October]\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-05-15\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Continuing our themed food and drink gatherings, we are pleased to present a very civilised afternoon of cheese and port!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Hosted by Lottie & Spencer this is not an educational journey in the same way our wine tasting nights are, but a simple afternoon of cheese and port.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>There's no pressure or speed to move between the flavours, we'll simply serve platters of bread, cheese, crackers, grapes, olives etc. And then begin serving port, each time we return to your table, we'll serve a different port until all 7 types have been served.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>If you need a break from the port, other refreshments will be available to purchase individually.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The event window will begin at 1pm but you can turn up at 2pm or even 3pm to work around other commitments, 3.15pm no problem. The event window closes at 4pm to new attendees and serving will end at 6pm.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Food platters are served just once so pace yourself, and port is served at your leisure, until all 7 ports have toured your table.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Gluten-free platter varients are available at no additional costs.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Whether you come as a party of one, or as a group, we'll actively be encouraging conversation between yourselves and lone participants can join a table of solo cheese-ologists and we'll prepare ice breakers to gets conversation flowing between strangers.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Please note although the event is listed as being in screen 6, this is just so we can limit the number of spaces. The event will actually take place in the bar area.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1778869957IMG_4204.webp1.jpg\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1778869957IMG_4204.webp\",\"url_key\":\"port2\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/port2?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-04\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"5h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"123\",\"name\":\"Food and Drink events\",\"short_name\":\"food and\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"15046\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"cDE2MDV2QWErMlZMU1FHUzBpZklpZz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/port2\\/showtimes\\/2026-10-04\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=cDE2MDV2QWErMlZMU1FHUzBpZklpZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"29\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 6\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-04\",\"show_time_slots\":\"1:00PM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"13.00\",\"time_sorting\":1791115200,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,