          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1160\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Baby Classes with Donna from Basking Babies\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-04-10\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>At Lumiere, we are more than just a cinema, we are a community space for a variety of activities.&nbsp;As an example we now host weekly Baby Yoga and Baby Massage classes on Friday mornings!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The typical weekly schedule is as below, but some weeks' classes are subject to change (for example we've started adding Parent & Baby Sound Bath sessions)&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">so always consult Donna's website for the exact class timetable here<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>10am-10.45am: Crawling baby yoga<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>11am-11.45am: Pre-Crawling baby yoga<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>12pm-1.30pm: Baby Massage<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>To book classes:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\\\">https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>If you have any questions please contact Donna at Basking Babies Romford directly:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>E-mail:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"mailto:Donna@baskingbabies.co.uk\\\">Donna@baskingbabies.co.uk<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Phone: 07931 429 634<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1775604491image_51.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1775604983image_52.webp\",\"url_key\":\"baby-classes-basking-babies\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/baby-classes-basking-babies?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"63\",\"name\":\"Arts, Crafts and Mindfulness\",\"short_name\":\"arts & min\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"92\",\"name\":\"Baby classes\",\"short_name\":\"baby class\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"18174\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"dm5XUXFDbXJSSlBBazBNSGRSR3plZz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/baby-classes-basking-babies\\/showtimes\\/2026-10-09\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=dm5XUXFDbXJSSlBBazBNSGRSR3plZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"0\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 6\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:00AM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.00\",\"time_sorting\":1791536400,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-08-12 17:15:41\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-10-09\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1480\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Emerald Forest\",\"date_release_date\":\"1985-06-22\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United Kingdom, United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>For ten years, engineer Bill Markham has searched tirelessly for his son Tommy who disappeared from the edge of the Brazilian rainforest. Miraculously, he finds the boy living among the reclusive Amazon tribe who adopted him. And that's when Bill's adventure truly begins. For his son is now a grown tribesman who moves skillfully through this beautiful-but-dangerous terrain, fearful only of those who would exploit it. And as Bill attempts to \\\"rescue\\\" him from the savagery of the untamed jungle, Tommy challenges Bill's idea of true civilization and his notions about who needs rescuing.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/fdRlqPnPFaPyQqS3KiBLJwWQPBe.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/vWZJBQ3TdG9S3FGqlJcqvb1JOa6.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-emerald-forest-1985\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/the-emerald-forest-1985?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=XPARBhwKNrs\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"XPARBhwKNrs\",\"duration\":\"2