            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1428\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Redemption Horror Day\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-10-10\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Horror\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Screaming Skull Presents: REDEMPTION DAY<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Come one, come all to the Lumiere Cinema on 10th October 2026 where one of Britain's most distinctive cult film labels REDEMPTION FILMS will be showcasing their all-you-can-watch sexy sinful horror collection! This 18+ film festival is bound to satisfy your desires for satanic, erotic, vampiric and even nun horror.<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>7 classic Redemption Films (see below for lineup)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Film and Horror related traders and vendors<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Horror and Glamour VIP Guests<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Licensed bar<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Concessions stand<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>The films being screened will be: <em>Fascination, The Iron Rose, Lips of Blood, Black Magic Rites, 13 Notes in Red, How Far Does The Dark Go, Sacred Flesh<\\/em>.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/app.promotix.com\\/events\\/details\\/REDEMPTION-DAY-tickets\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Please note this a third-party event and tickets need to be booked via the link here<\\/a> <\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Sponsored by THE DARK SIDE MAGAZINE & VIDEO DUNGEON<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1784803445ef5d0819-7891-4af7-aba1-0d2cb466daa5.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1784803445download_15.webp\",\"url_key\":\"redemption-day\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/redemption-day?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-10\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_t