ale of two intertwining love stories, that of young dreamers Orpheus and Eurydice, and King Hades and his wife Persephone. Filmed live on stage in London&rsquo;s West End and featuring the original Broadway stars, HADESTOWN: THE MUSICAL invites audiences on a hell-raising journey to the underworld and back.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Tickets go live 10am on 13th August.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1786100121Hadestown_One_Sheet.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1786100120Hadestown_Quad.webp\",\"url_key\":\"hadestown-the-musical-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/hadestown-the-musical-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-18\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=S9tHx2wHdpQ\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"S9tHx2wHdpQ\",\"duration\":\"2h 50m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Reeve Carney\"},{\"actor\":\"Eva Noblezada\"},{\"actor\":\"Andr\\u00e9 De Shields\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Brett Sullivan\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"38\",\"name\":\"Event Cinema\",\"short_name\":\"event cine\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"43\",\"name\":\"Big Screen Musicals\",\"short_name\":\"Musicals\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"1\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/12Acert1741549098.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"12A\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"12A\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for rese