":\"<p>Two of opera&rsquo;s most extraordinary artists return to The Met: Live in HD for Verdi&rsquo;s thrilling take on the immortal Shakespearean tale of the scheming couple determined to seize power at any cost.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Baritone Quinn Kelsey is the Scottish king haunted by the ghosts of his murderous ascent to the throne, opposite soprano Lise Davidsen as the power-mad Lady Macbeth,&nbsp; whose ruinous ambition&nbsp;damns them both.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Met Music Director Yannick N&eacute;zet-S&eacute;guin takes the podium for a penetrating&nbsp;production by Louisa Proske. Rounding out the all-star cast are tenor Freddie De Tommaso as&nbsp;Macduff and bass-baritone Ryan Speedo Green as Banquo.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be 1 interval during this performance.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Please note: unfortunately there will be no Sunday encore performance of this opera.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805287762627_RBO_Cinema_Thumbnail_Macbeth-2.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805287762627_RBO_Cinema_Thumbnail_Macbeth.webp\",\"url_key\":\"macbeth-met-opera\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/macbeth-met-opera?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-20\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=DHDQ0z4Uslo&t=2s\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"DHDQ0z4Uslo\",\"duration\":\"3h 39m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Quinn Kelsey\"},{\"actor\":\"Lise Davidsen\"},{\"actor\":\"Freddie De Tommaso\"},{\"actor\":\"Ryan Speedo Green\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Louisa Proske\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"6\",\"m