o the surface in this intoxicating romp from one of theatre&rsquo;s comedy masters.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1784820932BHD_FA_Poster_Trafalger_27x40.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17840594911378.webp\",\"url_key\":\"fallen-angels\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/fallen-angels?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-22\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 10m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Rose Byrne\"},{\"actor\":\"Kelli O\\u2019Hara\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Scott Ellis\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"38\",\"name\":\"Event Cinema\",\"short_name\":\"event cine\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"17043\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"dWJJMGdCODdjUnZHSzVZbjZFNVZBZz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/fallen-angels\\/showtimes\\/2026-10-22\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=dWJJMGdCODdjUnZHSzVZbjZFNVZBZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"35\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-22\",\"show_time_slots\":\"7:00PM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"19.00\",\"time_sorting\