The Royal Ballet, MacMillan&rsquo;s&nbsp;nuanced understanding of human psychology makes for an unflinching look into the moral&nbsp;degradation of Manon&rsquo;s Paris, while all its decadence and decay are brought to life through Jules&nbsp;Massenet&rsquo;s score and Nicholas Georgiadis&rsquo;s designs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be two intervals during this performance.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805306262627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Manon_-_Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805294652627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Manon_-_Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"manon-royal-ballet\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/manon-royal-ballet?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-27\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=DHDQ0z4Uslo&t=2s\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"DHDQ0z4Uslo\",\"duration\":\"3h 20m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"6\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/file21762743298.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"TBC\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"tbc\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"15589\",\"show_time_uuid\"