":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>In the seedy underbelly of 18th-century Paris, money is king. Nothing is sacred &ndash; even love itself can be bought for the right price. A native of this hedonistic underworld, Manon is caught between twin&nbsp;desires when she falls in love with the student Des Grieux. Steadfast and devoted, he offers the&nbsp;possibility of an honourable life. Yet, the riches promised by the world of Parisian society remain&nbsp;tempting...<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Manon&rsquo;s inner turmoil and struggle for survival lie at the devastating heart of Kenneth MacMillan&rsquo;s&nbsp;1974 adaptation of Abb&eacute; Pr&eacute;vost&rsquo;s novel. In this signature work of The Royal Ballet, MacMillan&rsquo;s&nbsp;nuanced understanding of human psychology makes for an unflinching look into the moral&nbsp;degradation of Manon&rsquo;s Paris, while all its decadence and decay are brought to life through Jules&nbsp;Massenet&rsquo;s score and Nicholas Georgiadis&rsquo;s designs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be two intervals during this performance.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805306262627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Manon_-_Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805294652627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Manon_-_Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"manon-royal-ballet\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/manon-royal-ballet?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-01\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=DHDQ0z4Uslo&t=2s\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"DHDQ0z4Uslo\",\"duration\":\"3h 20m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\"