 the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-11-01\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1395\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Once Upon a Time in America: The Extended Edition\",\"date_release_date\":\"1984-05-23\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United States of America, Italy\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Crime\"},{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>A former Prohibition-era Jewish gangster returns to the Lower East Side of Manhattan over thirty years later, where he once again must confront the ghosts and regrets of his old life.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The version we are screening is the longest version available, which has scenes of variable quality that are unable to be preserved.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The film will show with an intermission.&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/i0enkzsL5dPeneWnjl1fCWm6L7k.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/z1s7ASlypXYGeMLoJ2Np4CpWdzd.webp\",\"url_key\":\"once-upon-a-time-in-america-1984\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/once-upon-a-time-in-america-1984?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-01\",\"imdb_rate\":\"8.4\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=lFw062jAYR0\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"lFw062jAYR0\",\"duration\":\"4h 40m\",\"movie_year\":\"1984\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Robert De Niro\"},{\"actor\":\"James Woods\"},{\"actor\":\"Elizabeth McGovern\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Sergio Leone\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images