{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>Join us for a special festive wine tasting night!<\\/strong>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Simon Jarvis has been in the wine business for many years and now is bringing his wine skills for another special night at Lumiere, this time selectng wines to think about for Christmas. If you like any of the wines you'll be able to purchase wines from us following the event itself. Each wine priced lower than the RRP.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Each wine comes with a fun educational adventure as Simon explains the roots of the vineyard and a selection of bits of random trivia, you never knew you needed its a great opportunity to try new wines and make new friends. It's a wonderfully sophisticated evening, for those that either love wine or are taking their first steps into the world of wines.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Please note there are only 30 spaces available, and despite the fact it says it's in Screen 6, it will actually run in the bar area.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Over 18s only.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1784557588Untitled.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1784204642IMG_2812.webp\",\"url_key\":\"wine1-copy\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/wine1-copy?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-04\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"123\",\"name\":\"Food and Drink events\",\"short_name\":\"food and\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_nam