          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1449\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Downhill Racer\",\"date_release_date\":\"1969-11-06\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>An ambitious young skier, determined to break all existing records, is contemptuous of the teamwork advocated by the US coach when they go to Europe for the Olympics.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The film is noteable for delivering one of Robert Redford's first leadimg roles ans some could argue his most unlikeable performance. Downhill Racer also features an early performance from Gene Hackman.&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/cIHcteKsKc05fYYdXRctnpN9aT5.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/nWrbJR1tO73AnGQx7JNhfVlCn2Q.webp\",\"url_key\":\"downhill-racer-1969\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/downhill-racer-1969?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-05\",\"imdb_rate\":\"5.9\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=xD3XGfwlXOY\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"xD3XGfwlXOY\",\"duration\":\"2h 1m\",\"movie_year\":\"1969\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Robert Redford\"},{\"actor\":\"Gene Hackman\"},{\"actor\":\"Camilla Sparv\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Michael Ritchie\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_