          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"667\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Twin Peaks The Return\\/Season 3 Marathon [7th-8th November]\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-11-07\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"USA\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Horror\"},{\"name\":\"Mystery\"},{\"name\":\"Thriller\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Episode schedule<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Day 1: Saturday 7th November, 11am - approx 9pm.<\\/strong><br \\/>Episodes 1-9. Runtime including breaks = around 10 hours.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Day 2: Sunday 8th November,&nbsp;11am - approx 9pm.<\\/strong><br \\/>Episodes 10-18. Runtime including breaks = around 10 hours.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>There will be a 15 minute break after each pair of episodes (every 2 hours of screentime).<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>What your ticket gets you<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Your ticket gives you entrance to <strong>BOTH DAYS\\/all 18 episodes of Twin Peaks: The Return<\\/strong> served up over TWO glorious marathon days, with damn fine coffee and donuts thrown in with your ticket!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>About Twin Peaks: The Return\\/Season 3<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Set 25&nbsp;years after the events of the original&nbsp;Twin Peaks, the season follows multiple storylines, most of which are linked to&nbsp;FBI agent&nbsp;Dale Cooper&nbsp;(Kyle MacLachlan) and his 1989 investigation into the murder of high school student&nbsp;Laura Palmer&nbsp;(Sheryl Lee). In addition to the fictional&nbsp;Washington state&nbsp;town of&nbsp;Twin Peaks, the story extends to New York City,&nbsp;Las Vegas,&nbsp;South Dakota,&nbsp;New Mexico, and&nbsp;Texas.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Can't get enough of Twin Peaks?<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/twinpeaks-season1\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Twin Peaks: Season 1 - All Day Marathon<\\/a><\\/strong><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/twin-peaks-season2\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Twin Peaks: Season 2 - Two Day Marathon<\\/a><\\/strong> (split into two parts over two days),<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>and <strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/twinpeaks-thereturn\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Twin Peaks: The Return\\/Season 3 - Two Day Marathon<\\/a><\\/strong>&nbsp;(again split into two parts over two days).&nbsp;<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Search for \\\"Twin Peaks\\\" in the search bar.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17593649406683e69d435ffb1ece0d49a43b6f6f0c.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1758822911twpr.webp\",\"url_key\":\"twinpeaks-thereturn\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/twinpeaks-thereturn?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-07\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=W32wYIN4BX4\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"W32wYIN4BX4\",\"duration\":\"10h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"2017\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Kyle MacLachlan\"},{\"actor\":\"David Lynch\"},{\"actor\":\"Peggy Lipton\"},{\"actor\":\"Kimmy Robertson\"},{\"actor\":\"Richard Beymer\"},{\"actor\":\"Everett McGill\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"David Lynch\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"39\",\"name\":\"Marathons & All-Dayers!\",\"short_name\":\"all day\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"116\",\"name\":\"Twin Peaks season\",\"short_name\":\"Twin Peaks\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\