          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1456\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Educating Rita\",\"date_release_date\":\"1983-06-16\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United Kingdom\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Comedy\"},{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Rita, a witty 26-year-old hairdresser, wants to 'discover' herself, so she joins the Open University where she meets the disillusioned professor of literature, Dr. Frank Bryant. His marriage has failed, his new girlfriend is having an affair with his best friend and he can't get through the day without downing a bottle or two of whisky. What Frank needs is a challenge... and along comes Rita.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/xwxgiRzw2zxzWNIYp98faJ0rUy5.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/8azR9cFI9386ie9UBdwct0nBJNk.webp\",\"url_key\":\"educating-rita-1983\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/educating-rita-1983?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-10\",\"imdb_rate\":\"6.9\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=-9v_36XKfos\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"-9v_36XKfos\",\"duration\":\"2h 6m\",\"movie_year\":\"1983\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Michael Caine\"},{\"actor\":\"Julie Walters\"},{\"actor\":\"Michael Williams\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Lewis Gilbert\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"18314\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"dDZqRHZpVy9kWFBpRGRyakJQbms5QT09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/educating-rita-1983\\/showtimes\\/2026-11-10\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=dDZqRHZpVy9kWFBpRGRyakJQbms5QT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-10\",\"show_time_slots\":\"4:35PM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"16.35\",\"time_sorting\":1794328500,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-08-17 11:08:54\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-11-10\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1300\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Carmen: Royal Opera\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-11-10\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Under the oppressive heat of the Spanish sun, the fiercely independent Carmen attracts the attention of Don Jos&eacute;. She warns him not to fall in love with her, but his obsession knows no bounds.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Damiano Michieletto&rsquo;s searing production returns, casting scorching light on the lust, violence and destructive desire of Bizet&rsquo;s ever-popular opera.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>An all-star cast brings this white-hot drama to life, with Ginger Costa-Jackson in the fiery title role,&nbsp;alongside Russell Thomas as the jealous and despairing Don Jos&eacute;.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Following his 2023 Royal Opera&nbsp;debut, Sesto Quatrini returns to conduct Bizet&rsquo;s electrifying and sensual score.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be one interval during this performance.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805298402627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Carmen_-_Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805298402627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Carmen_-_Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"carmen-royal-opera\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/carmen-royal-opera?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-10\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=DHDQ0z4Uslo&t=2s\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"DHDQ0z4Uslo\",\"duration\":\"3h 45m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Ginger Costa-Jackson\"}],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party