          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1089\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Friday The 13th Marathon\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-11-13\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Horror\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>An ultra rare opportunity to see 8 of the Friday the 13th movies in one day!<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>See the first 8 chapters of the much loved franchise back-to-back with just a ten minute break in between, a full 13 hours of movies on the 13th of the month.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>From Jason's return, a few times, to his assault on New York City; with appearances by Kevin Bacon, Corey Feldman and Crispin Glover, a to thumping scored by Alice Cooper.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This is the best way to spend Friday the 13th with us at Lumiere.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1772229264IMG_3982.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1772229263IMG_3981.webp\",\"url_key\":\"friday13ths\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/friday13ths?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-13\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"13h 30m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"39\",\"name\":\"Marathons & All-Dayers!\",\"short_name\":\"all day\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"12196\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"eXVoUmVTeHMvSkRId0tWUXdIczZKQT09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/friday13ths\\/showtimes\\/2026-11-13\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=eXVoUmVTeHMvSkRId0tWUXdIczZKQT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"4\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-13\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:00AM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.00\",\"time_sorting\":1794564000,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-02-27 22:03:17\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-11-13\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1160\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Baby Classes with Donna from Basking Babies\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-04-10\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>At Lumiere, we are more than just a cinema, we are a community space for a variety of activities.&nbsp;As an example we now host weekly Baby Yoga and Baby Massage classes on Friday mornings!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The typical weekly schedule is as below, but some weeks' classes are subject to change (for example we've started adding Parent & Baby Sound Bath sessions)&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">so always consult Donna's website for the exact class timetable here<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>10am-10.45am: Crawling baby yoga<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>11am-11.45am: Pre-Crawling baby yoga<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>12pm-1.30pm: Baby Massage<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>To book classes:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\\\">https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>If you have any questions please contact Donna at Basking Babies Romford directly:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>E-mail:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"mailto:Donna@baskingbabies.co.uk\\\">Donna@baskingbabies.co.uk<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Phone: 07931 429 634<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1775604491image_51.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1775604983image_52.webp\",\"url_key\":\"baby-classes-basking-babies\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/baby-classes-basking-babies?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-13\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"63\",\"name\":\"Arts, Crafts and Mindfulness\",\"short_name\":\"arts & min\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"92\",\"name\":\"Baby classes\",\"short_name\":\"baby class\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"18178\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"UGhwZ3ZwQVRKQlUyeldXRmV6S3RZdz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/baby-classes-basking-babies\\/showtimes\\/2026-11-13\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=UGhwZ3ZwQVRKQlUyeldXRmV6S3RZdz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"0\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 6\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-13\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:00AM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.00\",\"time_sorting\":1794564000,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-08-12 17:15:41\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-11-13\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1482\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Jeremiah Johnson\",\"date_release_date\":\"1972-09-10\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Western\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>A mountain man who wishes to live the life of a hermit becomes the unwilling object of a long vendetta by Indians when he proves to be the match of their warriors in one-on-one combat on the early frontier.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/fANj1S3UmBB51wnKxYRKtw8LMBn.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/zL2MFBqi9w3faqi1aZW18p838dL.webp\",\"url_key\":\"jeremiah-johnson-1972\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/jeremiah-johnson-1972?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-13\",\"imdb_rate\":\"7.3\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=QFLwH-ZZ1MY\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"QFLwH-ZZ1MY\",\"duration\":\"2h 8m\",\"movie_year\":\"1972\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Robert Redford\"},{\"actor\":\"Will Geer\"},{\"actor\":\"Delle Bolton\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Sydney Pollack\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by