          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1494\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Doctor Who: The Tomb of the Cybermen\",\"date_release_date\":\"1967-09-23\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United Kingdom\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Adventure\"},{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Horror\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Aided by his two assistants Jamie and Victoria, the Doctor lands the TARDIS on Telos, last resting place of the infamous Cybermen. There he discovers a band of archaelogists on a secret expedition to unearth the reason for his old enemies' extinction. In the underground shadowy depths, they find the icy tomb. A whole army in hibernation. A threat to no one, if the temperature remains low. But if the traitor in their midst gets his way, things could really heat up.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>To coincide with a series of classic Who running in chronological order from the beginning of the Jon Pertwee era, we are screening select stories from William Hartnell and Patrick Troughton's era. This will be selected and shown randomly. &nbsp;Sadly with so many episodes and stories missing from these eras it's hard to follow any narrative storylines in this period, with key episodes missing from stories like The Dalek Masterplan. Or where certain stories have been recreated through animation, it's hard to license these stories. We hope you'll however appreciate a mix of classic stories from this period.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Tomb Of The Cybermen was initially considered a lost story, but in the early 1990's it was found we hope you'll however appreciate enjoy this dark chapter of early Who.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/frHlG8cmweSTPhN00N21KTvePYA.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/mwIY12EmJQtVVdPUU9Rv5fkQMMh.webp\",\"url_key\":\"doctor-who-the-tomb-of-the-cybermen-1967\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/doctor-who-the-tomb-of-the-cybermen-1967?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-14\",\"imdb_rate\":\"8.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"1967\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Patrick Troughton\"},{\"actor\":\"Deborah Watling\"},{\"actor\":\"Frazer Hines\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Morris Barry\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"126\",\"name\":\"Classic Doctor Who\",\"short_name\":\"dr who\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"18033\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"RUpGRCs4bXI1Q0N2REo2Y2szd2Zndz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/doctor-who-the-tomb-of-the-cybermen-1967\\/showtimes\\/2026-11-14\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=RUpGRCs4bXI1Q0N2REo2Y2szd2Zndz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 6\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-14\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:00AM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.00\",\"time_sorting\":1794650400,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-08-09 10:58:06\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-11-14\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1396\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Oliver Stone's Wild Palms\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-07-14\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Sci-Fi\"},{\"name\":\"Thriller\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Set in the future (now our past), dysfunctional couple Harry and Grace begin to discver everything they thought they knew was a lie. A battle begins between two rivalling factions the Friends & The Fathers. A battle over VR and a drug called Mimozine that makes VR seem real.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This TV show by Oliver Stone from the 1990s will show in one full day with breaks every 90 minutes.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>An ensemble cast that rivals Twin Peaks in its awesomeness and a scorching soundtrack of East Asian music and 60s & 70s rock ballads.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong><em>We have seen the future and it is Channel 3!<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1784119849wild.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1784119848wp2.webp\",\"url_key\":\"wildpalms\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/wildpalms?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-14\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=sHrpoNAgkiU\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"sHrpoNAgkiU\",\"duration\":\"7h 30m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"James Belushi\"},{\"actor\":\"Kim Cattral\"},{\"actor\":\"Robert Loggia\"},{\"actor\":\"David Warner\"},{\"actor\":\"Angie Dickinson\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Oliver Stone\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"38\",\"name\":\"Event Cinema\",\"short_name\":\"event cine\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"39\",\"name\":\"Marathons & All-Dayers!\",\"short_name\":\"all day\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"17116\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"QzFUSmR3WHlTcnphS0QwNW04d3BsZz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/wildpalms\\/showtimes\\/2026-11-14\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=QzFUSmR3WHlTcnphS0QwNW04d3BsZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"4\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 7\",\"sess