merican classic.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>1930s New York, at the height of the Depression. Joe Bonaparte is a gifted young violinist with a future in music, until a chance at fame and fortune lures him into the brutal world of professional boxing. He must confront what he&rsquo;s willing to sacrifice, who he&rsquo;s willing to become and how to find his place in a world that demands he choose a side.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Filmed live from the Almeida Theatre and featuring a live string quartet, Olivier Award-winner Sam Yates (Vanya) directs this propulsive drama exploring ambition, identity, and the high price of success.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/hYfGOJlr1WTJU1IRA5Sb7a14Xba.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/cuFQW97i7EycBYSIcZqAktJs5uj.webp\",\"url_key\":\"national-theatre-live-golden-boy-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/national-theatre-live-golden-boy-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-29\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=hCS4Y_MBhuo\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"hCS4Y_MBhuo\",\"duration\":\"3h 20m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Josh O'Connor\"},{\"actor\":\"Jason Barnett\"},{\"actor\":\"Richard Fleeshman\"},{\"actor\":\"Daniel Mays\"},{\"actor\":\"Hayley Squires\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Sam Yates\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"38\",\"name\":\"Event Cinema\",\"short_name\":\"event cine\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"69\",\"name\":\"National Theatre Live\",\"short_name\":\"nt-live\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"