          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1301\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Nutcracker: Royal Ballet\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-11-29\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>At a cosy Christmas party, young Clara meets the mysterious magician Drosselmeyer, who gives her a&nbsp;nutcracker doll. When the guests have departed and the house is asleep, Clara sneaks downstairs in&nbsp;search of the doll. Instead, she finds Drosselmeyer, who whisks her away on a journey into a whole&nbsp;world of enchantment: fantastical landscapes of flurried snow and glittering confection where toys&nbsp;come alive and the magic never stops.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Peter Wright&rsquo;s production of this festive family favourite sparkles to the wondrous swell of&nbsp;Tchaikovsky&rsquo;s orchestral score, alongside the glow and grandeur of Julia Trevelyan Oman&rsquo;s period&nbsp;designs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be one interval during this performance.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805302432627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Nutcracker_-_Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805302432627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Nutcracker_-_Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-nutcracker-ballet\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/the-nutcracker-ballet?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-12-13\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=DHDQ0z4Uslo&t=2s\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"DHDQ0z4Uslo\",\"duration\":\"2h 30m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"m