          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1324\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"La Fanciulla del West: Metropolitan Opera\",\"date_release_date\":\"2027-01-23\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Puccini&rsquo;s exhilarating drama of the Wild West returns in a new staging by Richard Jones, marking the&nbsp;company&rsquo;s first new production of La Fanciulla del West in more than 30 years.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Soprano Sondra&nbsp;Radvanovsky makes her role debut as Minnie, the tough tavern owner with a heart of gold who finds&nbsp;love when she least expects it. Tenor SeokJong Baek is the dashing bandit who rambles into the&nbsp;remote California mining town to steal her heart, opposite baritone Christopher Maltman as the&nbsp;lawman determined to deliver justice&mdash;and win Minnie for himself.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Maestro Keri-Lynn Wilson takes&nbsp;the podium to conduct one of opera&rsquo;s most action-packed adventures, live from the Met stage to&nbsp;cinemas worldwide.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be 1 interval during the performance.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Please note: unfortunately there will be no Sunday encore performance of this opera.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/178205607409805b8d-4caa-4896-b217-252459113dbe.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820560743728f542-b1ce-4bed-b00e-218f6e4dfa33.webp\",\"url_key\":\"la-fanciulla-del-west\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/la-fanciulla-del-west?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2027-01-26\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"duration\":\"3h 35m\",\"movie_year\":\"2027\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Sondra Radvanovsky\"},{\"actor\":\"SeokJong Baek\"},{\"actor\":\"Christopher Maltman\"}],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"16177\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"UXJmNG82WCtnTlVJeWh2TXJtSU1qdz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/la-fanciulla-del-west\\/showtimes\\/2027-01-26\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=UXJmNG82WCtnTlVJeWh2TXJtSU1qdz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"35\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_date\":\"2027-01-26\",\"show_time_slots\":\"6:00PM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"18.00\",\"time_sorting\":1800986400,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\