            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1326\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Cos\\u00ec fan tutte: Royal Opera\",\"date_release_date\":\"2027-02-23\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Spurred on by a bet, two young men hatch a plan to test the fidelity of their girlfriends. What follows&nbsp;is a slippery game of seduction and power, the four lovers plunging into a dizzying world of shifting&nbsp;reality, where truth becomes increasingly unstable.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Cos&igrave; fan tutte has lost none of its sting since it first scandalised audiences in 1790. In her Main Stage&nbsp;debut, Netia Jones, Associate Director of The Royal Opera, reimagines Mozart&rsquo;s comedy of manners&nbsp;through a sharp contemporary lens, where 18th-century romantic trickery meets deeply satirical&nbsp;high-tech deceit.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Taking on the roles of the lovers is an exciting young cast led by Louise Alder,&nbsp;Simone McIntosh, Mingjie Lei and Huw Montague Rendall, with Gerald Finley as their manipulative&nbsp;game-master Don Alfonso and Emily Pogorelc as Despina. Thomas Hengelbrock conducts, bringing&nbsp;out the exquisite melodies that underpin the provocative, and resolutely modern, themes at the&nbsp;heart of the opera.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be 1 interval during this production.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820615452627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Cosi_fan_Tutte_-_Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820615442627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Cosi_fan_Tutte_-_Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"cos-fan-tutte\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/cos-fan-tutte?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2027-02-28\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"duration\":\"3h 40m\",\"movie_year\":\"2027\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"16181\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"UFFyK3pwb01VUnkvNTRLSExncXFGdz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/cos-fan-tutte\\/showtimes\\/2027-02-28\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=UFFyK3pwb01VUnkvNTRLSExncXFGdz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"35\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_date\":\"2027-02-28\",\"show_time_slots\":\"2:00PM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"14.00\",\"time_sorting\":1803823200,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,