          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1327\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Alice's Adventures in Wonderland: Royal Ballet\",\"date_release_date\":\"2027-03-23\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>At a garden party on a sunny afternoon, Alice is surprised to see her parents&rsquo; friend Lewis Carroll&nbsp;transform into a white rabbit. When she follows him down a rabbit hole, events become curiouser&nbsp;and curiouser&hellip;As Alice journeys through Wonderland, she encounters countless strange creatures.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>She&rsquo;s swept off her feet by the charming Knave of Hearts, who&rsquo;s on the run for stealing the tarts.&nbsp;Confusion piles upon confusion. Then Alice wakes with a start. Was it all a daydream?<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Christopher Wheeldon&rsquo;s Alice&rsquo;s Adventures in Wonderland burst onto the stage in 2011 in an&nbsp;explosion of colour, stage magic and inventive, sophisticated choreography. Joby Talbot&rsquo;s score&nbsp;combines contemporary soundworlds with sweeping melodies that gesture to ballet scores of the<br \\/>19th century. Bob Crowley&rsquo;s wildly imaginative, eye-popping designs draw on everything from&nbsp;puppetry to projections to make Wonderland wonderfully real. The result shows The Royal Ballet at&nbsp;its best, bringing together world-class dance with enchanting family entertainment and ingenious&nbsp;music and design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be 2 intervals during this performance.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820619052627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Alice_-_Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820619052627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Alice_-_Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"alices-adventures-in-wonderland\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/alices-adventures-in-wonderland?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2027-03-23\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"duration\":\"3h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"2027\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"16182\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"RWJnVnc5dnIzcUFUdkxMQmhSSVJ2UT09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/alices-adventures-in-wonderland\\/showtimes\\/2027-03-23\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=RWJnVnc5dnIzcUFUdkxMQmhSSVJ2UT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"35\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_date\":\"2027-03-23\",\"show_time_slots\":\"7:15PM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"19.15\",\"time_sorting\":1805829300,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_